              %strong extensional
          %p
            For example, consider the identity prefunction on the set of pairs of positive numbers,
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
